    {
      "position": 3,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "Customarily used only with a set number of verbs like \"can't stand to look\", \"can't stand to hear\" \"can't stand to read\" \"can't stand to face up to\" - 見る、聴く、読む、正視する",
